      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-10-23_WidnesExaminer_art0073" n="art0073">
        <head>Marriage.</head>
        <p>Marriage.</p>
        <p>DALE—TAYLOR.—On October 17th, at Wycliffe Church, Warrington, by the Rev. C. P. Pitt, Private A. G. Dale, of • the Lancashire Hussars, only son of Councillor and Mrs. G. Dale, of 23, Lovely-lime, to Hilda, youngest daughter of Mr. and Mrs. C. Taylor, 114, Lovely-lane.</p>
