      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-10-23_WidnesExaminer_art0074" n="art0074">
        <head>Deaths.</head>
        <p>Deaths.</p>
        <p>ASHTON.—October 16th, at 25, New-road, Joeeph</p>
