        <p>Travis, aged 66 years. TlCKLE.—October 16th, at .38, Naylor-street. Thomas Tickle, aged 60 years. WALSH.—October 18th, at 29, Victoria-street, Michael Walsh, aged 79 years. WORSLEY.—October 12th, at 9, Hardy-street. Mary Worsley, aged 70 years.</p>
