      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1915-10-23_WidnesExaminer_art0171" n="art0171">
        <head>LAft LORD ROBERTS.</head>
        <p>THE LAft LORD ROBERTS.</p>
        <p>There will he a special, service in memory of the late Lord Roberts7iit St. Margaret's, West- minster, at 12.15 o'clock ol Saturday, November 13th, the anniversary of death. Friads and brother officers desiring to attend are re- quested to send their name 4 to the Rector of .St. Margaret's, 17, -Dean's Ya4rd, Westminster, in order that seats may,. as hAr as pdggible, be reseryod. for Om.</p>
