        <p>KILLED. PRIVATE T. WARBURTON. Officer Says Ile Died A Brave And Gallant Soldier. Mrs. Warburton, of 52, Brick-street, War- rington, has received official notification from the War Office that her husband was killed whilst doing duty in the machine gun .section of the Territorials during the great British advance. The late Private Warburton was widely known and respected by a large circle of friends, especially his workmates at Messrs.</p>
